[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9243.429, "timestamp": "02:34:03", "text": "是的。是的。好的。嗯，现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9247.91, "timestamp": "02:34:07", "text": "从这里，呃，你要去取你的令牌，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9250.389, "timestamp": "02:34:10", "text": "清除令牌，并尝试将其移动到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9252.389, "timestamp": "02:34:12", "text": "就像那个房间，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9253.75, "timestamp": "02:34:13", "text": "呃，注意我的房间，里面有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9255.91, "timestamp": "02:34:15", "text": "交易假人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9257.59, "timestamp": "02:34:17", "text": "如果你按下 Esc 键，你就可以看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9258.79, "timestamp": "02:34:18", "text": "顺便说一句，这是每个人的看法，如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9259.51, "timestamp": "02:34:19", "text": "不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9261.429, "timestamp": "02:34:21", "text": "所以，就像，是啊，因为那是你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9263.11, "timestamp": "02:34:23", "text": "令牌的视角。现在，这成了大家的看法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9264.63, "timestamp": "02:34:24", "text": "尝试将你的代币移动到类似……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9268.79, "timestamp": "02:34:28", "text": "那个东西，就是放训练假人的房间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9272.07, "timestamp": "02:34:32", "text": "呃，训练假人在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9274.71, "timestamp": "02:34:34", "text": "嗯，它应该在那里。你可以看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9277.99, "timestamp": "02:34:37", "text": "它。它有名字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9281.27, "timestamp": "02:34:41", "text": "培训"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9283.11, "timestamp": "02:34:43", "text": "钢琴旁边。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9284.87, "timestamp": "02:34:44", "text": "哦，这个。哦好的。好的。好的。知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9286.469, "timestamp": "02:34:46", "text": "所以，我得去那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9288.55, "timestamp": "02:34:48", "text": "是的。试着搬到那边去。你知道吗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9290.55, "timestamp": "02:34:50", "text": "怎么做呢？哦，是的。如果您点击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9291.75, "timestamp": "02